      "heading": "B — Audience, level and prerequisites: steering, braking, signals, reversing, turning and parking",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience, level and prerequisites: steering, braking, signals, reversing, turning and parking\nAudience: first-time New Jersey Class D applicants learning basic vehicle control before practice driving and the road test.\nWhy it matters to a first-timer: signal rules and hand signals are classic knowledge-test items [A04], and the reversing and turning rules preview what the road test asks for [A05].\nLevel: rule and procedure recall with some exact figures (signal distance, horn range, reverse speed, curb distance, stopping table rows); moderate load.\nPrerequisites: the starting checklist and mirror setup from the previous section.\n",
